From: coreboot board integration
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: isolate the board read-only FMP SPI probe

The FCH_SPI variable provider remains limited to upper NVAR. Give FmpDxe a
separate component-scoped, read-only 32-MiB SPI provider. Whole-flash writes
and erases intentionally return EFI_UNSUPPORTED at this stage.

--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
@@ -1263,6 +1263,9 @@
     <LibraryClasses>
 !if $(BOOTLOADER) == "COREBOOT"
       FmpDeviceLib|UefiPayloadPkg/Library/FmpDeviceSmmLib/FmpDeviceSmmLib.inf
+!if $(VARIABLE_SUPPORT) == "FCH_SPI"
+      SmmStoreLib|UefiPayloadPkg/Library/FchCapsuleReadLib/FchCapsuleReadLib.inf
+!endif
 !else
       # TODO: provide platform-specific implementation of firmware flashing
       FmpDeviceLib|FmpDevicePkg/Library/FmpDeviceLibNull/FmpDeviceLibNull.inf
